{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422646001:1":{"text":"你怎么能让鸭子都跑了呢，我、我不是跟你说好几遍要注意吗！","source_cn":"你怎么能让鸭子都跑了呢，我、我不是跟你说好几遍要注意吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C17FAD92F61AD28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422646002:1":{"text":"对不起，这本书我一不小心就看入迷了，没注意鸭子们……","source_cn":"对不起，这本书我一不小心就看入迷了，没注意鸭子们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AB47F0886B6A1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422646003:1":{"text":"我、我赔你吧，真的太对不起了！","source_cn":"我、我赔你吧，真的太对不起了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98570F72466E87BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422646004:1":{"text":"不行啊，这些鸭子是我祖母专门养的，只是带来上山放放风。","source_cn":"不行啊，这些鸭子是我祖母专门养的，只是带来上山放放风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68BA9939E47808F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422646005:1":{"text":"出什么事了？","source_cn":"出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE34C83E051767FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1